{"ai_route":{"actual_response_model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","ai_run_id":"airun_20261006101940_d9041cb7","expected_response_model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","fallback_chain_id":"aifb_45aa26dc3a79762c5dbcf875","fallback_depth":0,"fallback_reason":"","model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","provider":"mtplx","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","route_base_url":"http://127.0.0.1:8002/v1","route_identity_hash":"c9480819205db8521fec70763515cf905334434da194fa8ae2172b40ab545075","route_profile_id":"independent_ai__mtplx_qwen38_local","thinking":"enabled"},"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006101940_d9041cb7","chunk_index":7,"job_id":"mwjob_1a7d3c98bd9231c7d257b68d","precondition_digest":"25a7217475b50b466cc6b697814dfa2235e5469cc4b976bd0f382ab589d56d96","project_id":"proj_user_87445eff5d37","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v10","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_87445eff5d37_631b25f2b70aab30","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_87445eff5d37_b96858b0bd8a4bd8","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_87445eff5d37_7d322901c53391da","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_87445eff5d37_38db20a816f229e6"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006101940_d9041cb7","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_7caf4ee56243f34753ab:revision:6","quote":"试验药物：SMOKE-r6-1X口服sGC刺激剂（KZ-sGC601）","quote_sha256":"b3209b8014ed9c2be2a20adb96b313544d0a842e55d14ab82bea76601054062d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7caf4ee56243f34753ab:r6:ab8a1fd8e763e40c","span_id":"es_drug_identity"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_7caf4ee56243f34753ab:revision:6","quote":"SMOKE-r6-1X口服sGC刺激剂（KZ-sGC601）：低剂量2.5 mg qd、中剂量5 mg qd、高剂量10 mg qd，每日晨起随餐口服；每4周随访评估耐受性，按方案规定剂量调整。","quote_sha256":"107a0d9880df2b95f6e1cd122bcb278290ffb5a3479c184c86be5d676b1b69ae","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7caf4ee56243f34753ab:r6:ab8a1fd8e763e40c","span_id":"es_dose_regimen"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_7caf4ee56243f34753ab:revision:6","quote":"安慰剂平行对照：外观与气味与试验药一致的模拟片，每日一次，给药与访视安排同试验组，联合相同GDMT背景，按1:1:1:1随机分配。","quote_sha256":"be1f2f8d5224812fb65406cf191b819e4bb7668a1995791a1358f3ee011d1fcc","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7caf4ee56243f34753ab:r6:ab8a1fd8e763e40c","span_id":"es_placebo"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_drug_identity","es_dose_regimen","es_placebo"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"gap_items":[],"heading":"研究药物信息","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究的试验药物为SMOKE-r6-1X口服sGC刺激剂（KZ-sGC601），属小分子化合物，以口服固体制剂形式给药，产生全身性系统暴露。KZ-sGC601设置低剂量2.5 mg、中剂量5 mg和高剂量10 mg三个剂量水平，每日一次晨起随餐口服，双盲治疗期共12周。安慰剂为外观与气味与试验药一致的模拟片，每日一次给药，给药与访视安排同试验组，联合相同GDMT背景治疗。试验药与安慰剂按1:1:1:1比例随机分配至三个活性剂量组及安慰剂组。本研究采用双盲双模拟设计，受试者每日同时服用试验药或安慰剂及对应的模拟片，以维持盲态。治疗期间每4周随访评估耐受性，剂量调整依据方案规定执行。","rationale":"本段正文依据当前项目已确认研究事实中的试验药物名称、技术类型、剂型、给药途径、暴露范围、三个剂量水平、给药频率与时间、治疗周期、安慰剂描述及随机分配比例。医学作者需核实：双盲双模拟中模拟片是否需匹配重量、尺寸或刻痕；'晨起随餐'是否需与GDMT背景用药时间协调；'按方案规定剂量调整'的具体触发条件将在6.3章节定义。","review_advisories":["本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_87445eff5d37_631b25f2b70aab30","section_number":"6.1.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:11d75fc43f3620e55309629d","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7caf4ee56243f34753ab:r6:ab8a1fd8e763e40c"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006101940_d9041cb7","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"获取KZ-sGC601及安慰剂的制备工艺文件、包装规格说明、标签模板、储存条件与有效期数据、药物管理规程","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_612_packaging","missing_source_classes":["药物制备工艺与质量控制文件","包装规格与材料说明","标签格式与内容规范","储存条件与有效期数据","药物管理规程（含中心药房操作）"],"target":"6.1.2 制备、包装、标签、储存与管理"}],"heading":"制备、包装、标签、储存与管理","missing_source_classes":["药物制备工艺与质量控制文件","包装规格与材料说明","标签格式与内容规范","储存条件与有效期数据"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需要KZ-sGC601及安慰剂的制备工艺描述、包装规格与材料、标签格式与内容、储存条件（温度、湿度、光照）、有效期、运输条件、药物管理规程及中心药房操作要求等项目文件。当前允许来源仅确认药物为口服固体制剂且采用双盲双模拟设计，未包含上述任何制备、包装、标签、储存或管理的具体参数与规程。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_87445eff5d37_b96858b0bd8a4bd8","section_number":"6.1.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:11d75fc43f3620e55309629d","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7caf4ee56243f34753ab:r6:ab8a1fd8e763e40c"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006101940_d9041cb7","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"获取药物发放与配送流程、回收程序、清点方法、药物accountability记录格式及偏差处理规程","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_613_distribution","missing_source_classes":["药物发放与配送流程文件","药物回收与清点规程","药物accountability记录模板","中心药房与研究中心药物交接记录要求"],"target":"6.1.3 发放、回收与清点"}],"heading":"发放、回收与清点","missing_source_classes":["药物发放与配送流程文件","药物回收与清点规程","药物accountability记录模板","中心药房与研究中心药物交接记录要求"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需要药物发放流程（含中心药房至各研究中心的配送方式与记录）、受试者用药发放与登记程序、未使用药物回收程序、药物清点方法与频率、药物accountability记录格式及偏差处理等项目文件。当前允许来源未包含任何药物发放、回收或清点的具体流程与要求。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_87445eff5d37_7d322901c53391da","section_number":"6.1.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:11d75fc43f3620e55309629d","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7caf4ee56243f34753ab:r6:ab8a1fd8e763e40c"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006101940_d9041cb7","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"获取剂量调整触发条件（血压、肝酶、症状性低血压等阈值）、暂停与恢复标准、永久停药标准、调整后随访安排及IB中相关安全性数据","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_63_dose_adjustment","missing_source_classes":["剂量调整触发条件与操作标准","剂量暂停与恢复条件","永久停药标准","剂量调整后随访与安全性监测方案","研究者手册中相关安全性信息"],"target":"6.3 剂量调整、暂停、恢复与永久停药"}],"heading":"剂量调整、暂停、恢复与永久停药","missing_source_classes":["剂量调整触发条件与操作标准","剂量暂停与恢复条件","永久停药标准","剂量调整后随访与安全性监测方案"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需要剂量调整的具体触发条件（如收缩压阈值、肝酶升高倍数、症状性低血压分级）、剂量暂停标准与暂停后恢复条件、永久停药标准（含不可逆事件）、剂量调整后的随访安排及安全性监测要求等项目文件。当前允许来源仅提及'每4周随访评估耐受性，按方案规定剂量调整'及估计目标策略中'无论是否剂量调整均按随机分组分析'，未给出任何具体调整标准、暂停条件、恢复条件或永久停药标准。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_87445eff5d37_38db20a816f229e6","section_number":"6.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:11d75fc43f3620e55309629d","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7caf4ee56243f34753ab:r6:ab8a1fd8e763e40c"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"589de192487ec5b3218caf5827225d4c7057cf42e60331fa526eee88a2290c9b","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_87445eff5d37_b8c9b3f47b0875c6:full-draft:11d75fc43f3620e55309629d","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:11d75fc43f3620e55309629d","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:25a7217475b50b466cc6b697814dfa2235e5469cc4b976bd0f382ab589d56d96:11d75fc43f3620e55309629d","text_sha256":"589de192487ec5b3218caf5827225d4c7057cf42e60331fa526eee88a2290c9b"},{"content_sha256":"45ac26fc10926c13572b30670ac47eb806a07665e78bfee4d62ec8ceeaf701a9","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_7caf4ee56243f34753ab:revision:6","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7caf4ee56243f34753ab:r6:ab8a1fd8e763e40c","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_7caf4ee56243f34753ab:r6:ab8a1fd8e763e40c","text_sha256":"45ac26fc10926c13572b30670ac47eb806a07665e78bfee4d62ec8ceeaf701a9"}]}